+| `test/OwnerPowers.t.sol` | What the owner key can do to depositors |
+
+One change outside `test/`: I appended an `[invariant]` block to `foundry.toml`
+(`runs = 64`, `depth = 64`, `fail_on_revert = true`). `fail_on_revert = true` is there
+deliberately — it is what proves the invariant runs reached real vault states instead of
+bouncing off reverts. `src/`, `test/UsdtYieldVault.t.sol` and `test/mocks/` are untouched.
